<title>USA: Hannaford Feb sales rise 7.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Hannaford Feb sales rise 7.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SCARBOROUGH, Maine 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hannaford Bros Co said Friday that its sales and other revenues for the four weeks ended February 22 were $229,947,000, an increase of 7.9 percent over the $213,063,000 reported for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Sales and other revenues for the eight weeks ended February 22, 1997, were $463,132,000, up 8.7 percent over the $425,930,000 achieved during the first eight weeks of 1996.</p>
</text>
